  "discussion": "Claude's read, confirmed by Joel 2026-10-09. Match. FAIL on DSCR (0.13x) and leverage (36.5x pro forma). 'What would change this' shows it fails before this loan: existing debt service alone needs $59.4M of EBITDA against $6.7M. The floorplan treatment does not change the answer (see caveats).",
